    <statement><p>Write the following decimals as percentages.</p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 0.02 = }</m> <fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 0.2 = }</m> <fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</li>
<li>
