    <solution><p>To change a decimal to a percentage, we move the decimal point to the right twice.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 0.02 = 2\% }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 0.2 = 20\% }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 2 = 200\% }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 1 = 100\% }</m></p>
</solution>
